      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "READY TO DREAM NZ (8) worked to find the lead but found one better last start over 1740m at Riverina Paceway following on from a strong win there when returning from a spell the start prior. Should enjoy a nice smother from this draw and will be looking for a split at some stage. Meets a similar line up and he is a strong winning hope. ROCK SPIRIT (4) settled in the leading division but didn't find enough in the end and could only manage third last start over 2040m at Parkes, that effort coming after a win at Albury the run before. Ideally placed and is sure to be there at the finish. FLY OVER STATES (5) is better than his last-start ninth over 1740m at Riverina Paceway. Can bounce back. RUSTY MUDSHARK (2) is in the mix following a sixth at his most recent appearance over 1740m at Riverina Paceway. Include from the low draw.",
